# --- ATRAKCIJE U BLIZINI ---
msgid "Istražite okolicu"
msgstr "Explore the surroundings"

msgid "Livno i visoravan Kruzi nude nezaboravne avanture. Otkrijte divlju prirotu i ljepote koje vas okružuju na samo korak od vile."
msgstr "Livno and the Kruzi plateau offer unforgettable adventures. Discover the wild nature and beauties that surround you just a step away from the villa."

msgid "Divlji konji na Kruzima"
msgstr "Wild Horses on Kruzi"

msgid "Doživite nevjerojatan susret s preko 800 divljih konja koji desetljećima slobodno lutaju nepreglednim prostranstvima visoravni Kruzi."
msgstr "Experience an incredible encounter with over 800 wild horses that have been roaming freely across the vast expanses of the Kruzi plateau for decades."

msgid "Vidikovac Crna Stina"
msgstr "Crna Stina Viewpoint"

msgid "Posjetite samu Crnu Stinu po kojoj je naša vila dobila ime. Uživajte u spektakularnom pogledu na livanjski kraj i netaknutu prirodu."
msgstr "Visit the Crna Stina itself, after which our villa was named. Enjoy a spectacular view of the Livno region and untouched nature."

msgid "Planina Cincar"
msgstr "Mount Cincar"

msgid "Otkrijte skrivene planinarske staze, osvojite vrhove planine Cincar i udahnite najčistiji planinski zrak daleko od civilizacije."
msgstr "Discover hidden hiking trails, conquer the peaks of Mount Cincar, and breathe in the purest mountain air far from civilization."

